---
---
<!doctype html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; background: #fafafa; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; }
    .og {
      width: 1200px;
      height: 630px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 72px 80px;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    .eyebrow {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #94a3b8;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .headline {
      font-size: 52px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #0f172a;
      line-height: 1.15;
      max-width: 980px;
      margin: 24px 0 0 0;
    }
    .formula {
      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, "SF Mono", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
      font-size: 40px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #0f172a;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-left: 4px solid #0284c7;
      padding: 28px 36px;
      margin: 32px 0;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }
    .formula .op { color: #475569; font-weight: 500; }
    .formula .accent { color: #0284c7; }
    .subhead { font-size: 20px; color: #475569; max-width: 900px; line-height: 1.45; }
    .byline { font-size: 18px; color: #94a3b8; margin-top: 16px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="og" id="og-root">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">Product-Customer Coupling · Paper companion</div>
      <h1 class="headline">Switching cost has two components, not one.</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="formula">
      <span class="accent">switching cost</span>
      <span class="op">=</span>
      destruction cost
      <span class="op">+</span>
      exposure cost
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="subhead">Founders price destruction — feature parity, migration work. They under-price exposure. Enterprise pilots die on exposure.</div>
      <div class="byline">Companion to Babel, 2026 (SSRN)</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
